1
00:00:00,524 --> 00:00:02,484
(Penny:)Too bad.

2
00:00:04,987 --> 00:00:08,157
- You're going up Euclid Avenue?
- Mm-hm.

3
00:00:08,324 --> 00:00:09,994
(Sheldon:)Leonard takes Los Robles Avenue.

4
00:00:10,159 --> 00:00:11,789
(Penny:)Well, good for Leonard.

5
00:00:11,953 --> 00:00:15,493
(Sheldon:)Euclid Avenue is shorter as the crow flies,
but it has speed bumps...

6
00:00:15,665 --> 00:00:19,705
...which increase point-to-point drive time,
making it the less efficient choice.

7
00:00:21,754 --> 00:00:23,214
(Sheldon:)But you have the con.

8
00:00:24,715 --> 00:00:26,175
(Sheldon:)Oh!

9
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:31,680
(Sheldon:)If you're not going to slow down for
the speed bumps, I withdraw my objection.

10
00:00:33,474 --> 00:00:35,014
(Sheldon:)Here's a fun question.

11
00:00:35,184 --> 00:00:37,724
(Sheldon:)Do you know
what the most common street name is?

12
00:00:37,895 --> 00:00:40,435
(Leonard:)- No.
- The answer's tricky.

13
00:00:41,524 --> 00:00:42,694
(Sheldon:)It's Second Street.

14
00:00:42,858 --> 00:00:44,568
(Sheldon:)You'd think it would be First Street.

15
00:00:44,735 --> 00:00:48,075
(Sheldon:)In most towns, First Street eventually
gets renamed to something else.

16
00:00:48,239 --> 00:00:49,779
(Sheldon:)Like Main Street...

17
00:00:49,949 --> 00:00:51,279
(Sheldon:)...Broad Street...

18
00:00:51,450 --> 00:00:53,540
(Sheldon:)...Michigan Avenue.

19
00:00:53,703 --> 00:00:55,453
(Sheldon:)Leonard and I
often use our commute time...

20
00:00:55,621 --> 00:00:58,251
(Sheldon:)...to exercise our minds
with brain teasers like that.

21
00:00:58,708 --> 00:01:02,018
(Sheldon:)We also play games.

